Placeholder so `//go:embed all:frontend/dist` resolves on a clean checkout
before the SPA is built. The real assets (index.html, assets/*) are produced by
`pnpm build:client` and are git-ignored. Note: Vite's `emptyOutDir` removes this
file during a local build; that is expected — git restores it on checkout, and
once a build exists the directory is non-empty anyway.
